rustbar-item svg{display:none;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-point-body h3{font-size:20px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-pullquote{font-size:20px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-mini-pills{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px;max-width:280px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-carousel-card{width:124px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-proof-carousel{--ts-card-step:128px;}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-marquee-track,\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-carousel-track{animation:none;}\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"tryscent-listicle\">\n\n  <!-- HERO -->\n  <section class=\"ts-hero\">\n    <div class=\"ts-hero-inner\">\n      <div class=\"ts-hero-copy\">\n        <h1>\n          <span class=\"ts-light\">Disappointed by cheap perfumes before?</span>\n          Here Are 5 Reasons TryScent Actually Delivers\n        </h1>\n        <p class=\"ts-sub\">EU-made. 21% perfume oil. 12+ hours of wear. Proven by over 10,000 Swedes.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ts-hero-img\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/saffron_rose_amber.png?v=1767655299\" alt=\"TryScent Saffron Rose Amber fragrance\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- TRUST BAR -->\n  <div class=\"ts-trustbar\">\n    <div class=\"ts-trustbar-inner\">\n      <div class=\"ts-trustbar-item\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\"/><polygon points=\"15,10 21,10 22,17 15,17\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2\"/></svg>\n        Free shipping over 483 kr\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ts-trustbar-item\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3 L4 6 L4 13 c0 5 4 7 8 8 c4 -1 8 -3 8 -8 L20 6 Z\"/><polyline points=\"9,12 11,14 15,10\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        60-day open purchase\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- LISTICLE -->\n  <section class=\"ts-listicle-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"ts-listicle-inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">1</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ugc15.png?v=1756129303\" alt=\"TryScent customer holding bottle\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>It Actually Smells Like It Says It Does</h3>\n          <p>That sounds like a low bar. In this category, it isn't. The biggest failure of most fragrance alternatives is <strong>accuracy</strong>. At best they smell roughly similar and at worst nothing like the original.</p>\n          <p>TryScent's formulations are built around <strong>getting as close to the inspiration scent as possible</strong>, and buyers confirm again and again that they recognize the scent.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">2</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ugc13.png?v=1756129303\" alt=\"TryScent customer testimonial — lasts all day\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>12+ Hours Of Wear. Not 12+ Minutes.</h3>\n          <p>Longevity is the single biggest complaint about cheaper fragrance alternatives. They smell okay in the bottle but <strong>disappear from the skin within an hour</strong>.</p>\n          <p>TryScent is specifically formulated for <strong>all-day wear, 12+ hours</strong>, and several customers report it lasts longer than the designer original they switched from. That's a direct result of <strong>EU-quality ingredients</strong>, not a marketing claim.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">3</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/Designerperfym.png?v=1778094986\" alt=\"Designer perfume comparison — paying for the box\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>21% Perfume Oil — The Reason It Actually Lasts</h3>\n          <p>Most fragrance alternatives cut costs where it matters most: <strong>the concentration of perfume oil</strong>. Low concentration means low longevity.</p>\n          <p>TryScent uses <strong>21% perfume oil</strong>, which puts it on par with premium designer EDPs and far above the industry standard for alternatives. That's why customers report <strong>12+ hours of wear</strong>. And why some say it lasts longer than the original.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">4</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-17_at_10.59.01.jpg?v=1768713394\" alt=\"TryScent EU-certified manufacturing — IFRA-approved facility\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>Made In The EU, To The Same Standards As The Brands That Inspired It</h3>\n          <p>Most perfume brands don't tell you where or how their products are made. <strong>TryScent does.</strong></p>\n          <p>Every bottle is made in <strong>EU-certified facilities following IFRA ingredient standards</strong> — the same rules used by Dior, Chanel and Creed. No gray-market compounding. No oils of unknown origin. <strong>Real European manufacturing with full quality control, every batch.</strong></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">5</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ugc8.png?v=1756129303\" alt=\"TryScent customer — risk-free 60-day trial\">\n          <div class=\"ts-badge-60\">\n            <span class=\"ts-num\">60</span>\n            <span class=\"ts-lbl\">Days<br>Guarantee</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>Try It Risk-Free For 60 Days</h3>\n          <p>TryScent is confident enough in its product to give you <strong>60 days to decide</strong>. Wear it. Live in it. Test it for a whole month.</p>\n          <p>If it doesn't suit you, you get <strong>a full refund, no questions asked</strong>. Start with one bottle for 129 kr and find your scent.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- SOCIAL PROOF -->\n  <section class=\"ts-proof\">\n    <div class=\"ts-proof-top\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>Why TryScent Won't Disappoint You Like Other Dupes</h2>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"ts-proof-list\">\n        <li>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"4,12 10,18 20,6\"/></svg>\n          <span><strong>Up to 21% EDP concentration</strong> — significantly richer than the 12–15% most designer perfumes contain.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"4,12 10,18 20,6\"/></svg>\n          <span><strong>EU-made, IFRA-certified</strong> — made to the same ingredient standards as luxury brands that charge 10 times more.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"4,12 10,18 20,6\"/></svg>\n          <span><strong>60-day open purchase</strong> — try it, live in it, return it if it's not for you.</span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ts-proof-carousel\">\n      <div class=\"ts-carousel-track\">\n        <div class=\"ts-carousel-card\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ugc7.png?v=1756129304\" alt=\"Real TryScent customer holding bottle\"></div>\n        <div class=\"ts-carousel-card\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ugc1.png?v=1756129303\" alt=\"Real TryScent customer holding bottle\"></div>\n    